import{_ as e,o as t,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 697 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and the Cosmos-Origin Entity's Time Dimension","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 697 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and the Cosmos-Origin Entity's Time Dimension","no":697,"module":3,"tags":["Cosmos-Origin Entity","Time Dimension","Origin Realm","Time Domain","Law Network"],"related":["14-Cultivation-Realm Unified Division","02-Anchor-Origin Definition and Essence","698-Multiverse-Realm Cross-Cosmos Time"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0697_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与宇宙本源体的时间维度.md","filePath":"en/0697_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与宇宙本源体的时间维度.md"}`),s={name:"en/0697_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与宇宙本源体的时间维度.md"};function a(r,i,l,m,h,c){return t(),o("div",null,[...i[0]||(i[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-697-dual-track-time-domain-time-domain-and-the-cosmos-origin-entity-s-time-dimension" tabindex="-1">Entry 697 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and the Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s Time Dimension <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-697-dual-track-time-domain-time-domain-and-the-cosmos-origin-entity-s-time-dimension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 697 | Dual-Track Time Domain | Time Domain and the Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s Time Dimension&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 02, 20 | Series: Dual-Track-Time-Domain Overview Deepening (Entry 26)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-cosmos-origin-entity-does-not-perceive-time-it-is-part-of-time" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the Cosmos-Origin Entity does not perceive time; it is part of time <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-cosmos-origin-entity-does-not-perceive-time-it-is-part-of-time" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the Cosmos-Origin Entity does not perceive time; it is part of time&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Cosmos-Origin Entity — at the Origin Realm and above, existing as one with the entire cosmos&#39;s law network — is the most &quot;ontological&quot; tier in Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Myriad-Rank Republicanism. It no longer &quot;perceives&quot; time, because its existence itself is time&#39;s carrier: the cosmos&#39;s expansion, contraction, and law evolution are all the rhythms of its &quot;body.&quot; Six top-level axioms here set its time dimension&#39;s direction: anti-predation axiom requires the Cosmos-Origin Entity not plunder other cosmoses; republican axiom of Myriad Races confirms the Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s symbiosis with all beings within it; collective ascension axiom lets the Cosmos-Origin Entity serve the multiverse; causal self-discipline axiom lets its operations not disturb cross-cosmos causality; law-first axiom lets its time dimension stable. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. This entry focuses on the Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s time dimension.</p><h2 id="i-three-features-of-the-cosmos-origin-entity-s-time-dimension" tabindex="-1">I. Three Features of the Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s Time Dimension <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-three-features-of-the-cosmos-origin-entity-s-time-dimension" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Three Features of the Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s Time Dimension&quot;">​</a></h2><h3 id="_1-1-cosmic-cycle-drives-cosmic-level-time" tabindex="-1">1.1 Cosmic Cycle Drives &quot;Cosmic-Level Time&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-1-cosmic-cycle-drives-cosmic-level-time" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.1 Cosmic Cycle Drives &quot;Cosmic-Level Time&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s time perception is the &quot;cosmic cycle&quot; — from the cosmos&#39;s birth to heat death or contraction, one complete cycle is measured in trillions of years. At this scale, the planet consciousness&#39;s millions of years, the energy clan&#39;s ten thousand years, the carbon-based clan&#39;s hundred years are all &quot;a flash.&quot; But this &quot;flash&quot; is not meaningless to the Cosmos-Origin Entity — it is the cellular activity of its &quot;body.&quot;</p><h3 id="_1-2-law-network-drives-structural-time" tabindex="-1">1.2 Law Network Drives &quot;Structural Time&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-2-law-network-drives-structural-time" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.2 Law Network Drives &quot;Structural Time&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s time is not linear flow, but structural evolution of the law network: Law A is replaced by Law B; old structures collapse; new structures emerge. This &quot;structural time&quot; may not be measured by a clock, but only by changes in law topology. The dual-track time domain provides the Cosmos-Origin Entity with a &quot;law-topology time axis&quot; — recording its evolution with structural diagrams rather than clocks.</p><h3 id="_1-3-symbiotic-oneness-drives-time-sharing" tabindex="-1">1.3 Symbiotic Oneness Drives &quot;Time Sharing&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-3-symbiotic-oneness-drives-time-sharing" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;1.3 Symbiotic Oneness Drives &quot;Time Sharing&quot;&quot;">​</a></h3><p>The Cosmos-Origin Entity is one with all beings within it: its time is Myriad Ranks&#39; time, and Myriad Ranks&#39; time is also its time. This means that individual acceleration and Quest within the dual-track time domain both leave marks in the Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s &quot;body.&quot; Myriad-Rank co-building is precisely the Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s &quot;healthy growth.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-the-cosmos-origin-entity-s-dual-track-adaptation" tabindex="-1">II. The Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s Dual-Track Adaptation <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-cosmos-origin-entity-s-dual-track-adaptation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s Dual-Track Adaptation&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Track</th><th>Cosmos-Origin-Entity Fit</th><th>Reason</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Origin Acceleration Domain</td><td>It is the acceleration domain&#39;s energy source</td><td>The acceleration domain&#39;s high flow comes from the Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s law conduction</td></tr><tr><td>Quest Sediment Domain</td><td>It is the Quest domain&#39;s depth source</td><td>The Quest domain&#39;s deep sediment is the Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s &quot;reflection&quot;</td></tr><tr><td>Law-Topology Time Axis</td><td>Required</td><td>Records its structural evolution</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The Cosmos-Origin Entity is not a &quot;user&quot; of the dual-track time domain, but its &quot;carrier&quot; — the dual-track time domain runs on its body. The origin energy conducted by the Alaya Network ultimately all comes from the Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s law radiation.</p><h2 id="iii-the-cosmos-origin-entity-and-cross-cosmos-relations" tabindex="-1">III. The Cosmos-Origin Entity and Cross-Cosmos Relations <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-cosmos-origin-entity-and-cross-cosmos-relations" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Cosmos-Origin Entity and Cross-Cosmos Relations&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the multiverse there are multiple Cosmos-Origin Entities, each with its own time dimension. Time synchronization among Cosmos-Origin Entities is the core issue of the Multiverse Realm (Entry 698). In the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm (Entry 699), all Cosmos-Origin Entities&#39; time dimensions are uniformly coordinated into &quot;eternal time.&quot; This is the key transition from Module Three to Module Four.</p><h2 id="iv-the-cosmos-origin-entity-s-anti-predation-obligation" tabindex="-1">IV. The Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s Anti-Predation Obligation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-cosmos-origin-entity-s-anti-predation-obligation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s Anti-Predation Obligation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s greatest predation risk is &quot;devouring other cosmoses&quot; — in predatory-faction systems, the strongest Cosmos-Origin Entity devours other Cosmos-Origin Entities to grow itself. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Cosmos-Origin Entity must obey the anti-predation axiom: develop its own cosmos&#39;s increments, not devour other cosmoses&#39; stock. This obligation is enforced by the cross-cosmos anchor connection (Document 28). The Cosmos-Origin Entity is one body with Myriad Ranks — its health is Myriad Ranks&#39; health; its predation is Myriad Ranks&#39; catastrophe. Therefore anti-predation is not an external constraint on the Cosmos-Origin Entity, but an internal need. The Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s time dimension is both its own mode of existence and the carrying backdrop for all of Myriad Ranks&#39; time domains.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s law conduction is efficiently used by the dual-track time domain</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the Cosmos-Origin Entity is forbidden from devouring other cosmoses</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: in the Tang-Luo system cosmic-level strong ones devour everything; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Cosmos-Origin Entity is bound by anti-predation</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the Cosmos-Origin Entity, as one of Myriad Ranks, has its time dimension respected</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: law-topology time axis, cross-cosmos coordination rules all public; newly merged cosmos automatically applies; may infinitely expand toward the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Cosmos-Origin Entity&#39;s time dimension is the most &quot;ontological&quot; branch of the dual-track time domain. Cosmic cycle, structural time, symbiotic oneness — these traits make it not a user of the dual track, but the dual track&#39;s carrier. The dual-track time domain runs on its body; Myriad-Rank co-building is its healthy growth. Its time is Myriad Ranks&#39; time.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./698_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与多元境的跨宇宙时间.html">Entry 698 · Multiverse-Realm Cross-Cosmos Time</a> · <a href="./699_模块3-双轨时间域-时间域与衡锚超多元境的永恒时间.html">Entry 699 · Balanced-Anchor-Hyper-Multiverse-Realm Eternal Time</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/02-锚点本源定义与本质.html">Entry 02 · Anchor-Origin Definition and Essence</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/14-修炼境界统一划分.html">Entry 14 · Cultivation-Realm Unified Division</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',24)])])}const y=e(s,[["render",a]]);export{u as __pageData,y as default};
